{"id":"msg_m_ex_rosanna_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_rosanna","label":"Rosanna · Nikke"},"label":"3. Mister,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_rosanna_02","next":"msg_m_ex_rosanna_chicocean_01","speakers":{"rosanna":"Rosanna"},"icons":{"rosanna":"si_c280_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_1","text":"Mister,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_2","text":"do I come off as intimidating?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_3","text":"A bit.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_4","text":"Jeez, you didn't even hesitate.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_5","text":"I'm surprised.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_6","text":"Why do you ask?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_7","text":"I had a rather peculiar experience today.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_8","text":"While I was walking on the street,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_9","text":"a kid saw me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_10","text":"and dropped his candy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_11","text":"So, I grabbed the candy and gave it back to him.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_12","text":"I told him to be more careful and hold onto it tightly,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_13","text":"but then he started crying.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_14","text":"I was with some friends, and I asked them for some suggestions","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_15","text":"on how to cheer the kid up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_16","text":"They said smiling should do the trick, so I did.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_17","text":"... He took one look at me and ran off crying.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_18","text":"You'd think he was being chased by a pack of wild animals.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_19","text":"Did you say anything when you were smiling?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_20","text":"I didn't say much.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_21","text":"I just told him","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_22","text":"to stop crying.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_23","text":"With a smile on your face? I can't even imagine...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_24","text":"Stop crying :)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_25","text":"Kinda like that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_26","text":"It's hard to express over text.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_27","text":"Anyway,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_28","text":"kids these days get scared easy, I guess.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_29","text":"I don't know how they plan on surviving in this world if that's all it takes to send them into hysterics.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_30","text":"At any rate, I've confirmed","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_31","text":"what your first impression of me is.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_32","text":"I'll practice some facial expressions","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_33","text":"before seeing you again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rosanna_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rosanna_03_34","text":"Take care until then.","jump":null}],"chat":true}